# A reading the runtime refuses is said where it was asked for, with Read
# again on its banner, and Read again brings the page back once allowed.
wait-for Settings
scenario permission-denied
tap-paged Battery
wait-for Cobalt did not allow Settings to do that.
expect Read again
expect 72%
shot settings-battery-refused
scenario normal
tap Read again
wait-idle
expect-missing Cobalt did not allow Settings to do that.
expect Discharging
# The refusal belongs to Battery and is not repeated on other pages.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Settings
expect-missing Cobalt did not allow Settings to do that.
scenario permission-denied
tap-paged Model and versions
wait-for Cobalt did not allow Settings to do that.
expect Read again
shot settings-about-refused
scenario normal
tap Read again
wait-for Simulated Kobo Clara BW
expect-missing Cobalt did not allow Settings to do that.
expect From your computer
